        "LocalizationKey": "Far_Territory_BpCinchonaDecoction_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Simmer 2 Cinchona Bark for an hour in a cooking pot of freshly boiled water to make a decoction that eases swamp fever. The pot is not used up. Boil the water first: it cools within the hour."
